    IndependentSalesPartner
        Type: Section
        Role: Content
        Caption: Independent Sales Partner (Cybersecurity)
        Purpose: Terms, support, and requirements for independent B2B sales partners

        CommissionTerms
            Type: Text
            Caption: 20% Recurring Revenue Share
            Content: Earn 20% recurring revenue share from all payments of every client you bring in, for as long as you manage the commercial relationship with that client account.

        PreQualifiedLeadsAndDemo
            Type: Text
            Caption: Pre-Qualified Companies, Free Live-Code Demo & Ready Playbook
            Content: Partners receive pre-qualified companies with already identified code defects, a ready-to-use sales playbook, and a free demo (one complete technical breakdown on the prospect's live code sent directly by the founder to the client's official security contact).

        PartnerRequirements
            Type: Text
            Caption: Requirements & Zero-Friction Onboarding
            Content: Requires B2B sales experience, fluent spoken English with technical terminology, and the ability to reach CTOs and technical founders. No interviews, no entrance tests, and no employment commitments — send one line about yourself via DM or email to start.

    BusinessCoFounderTrack
        Type: Section
        Role: Content
        Caption: Business Co-Founder (Open via Sales Partner Track)
        Purpose: Path to Business Co-Founder based on real commercial results

        CoFounderDescription
            Type: Text
            Caption: Co-Foundership Proven in Action
            Content: The Business Co-Founder role — leading commercial growth, partnerships, fundraising, and the future company alongside the technical founder — opens up for candidates who prove themselves in action as sales partners. Co-foundership is demonstrated through real results working with clients, and top-performing partners are considered for Business Co-Founder.

